marker='Source download, source inspection, OCR, registry consolidation, and packaging scripts are also retained.'
extra='Additional mathematical computations completed before checkpoint 03:\n\n- A_numerical_tail_pairings.py: 25 assertions for the finite simplicial torus, its cup product, and all four modulo-four candidates in the numerical-tail obstruction; 0.000186 seconds.\n- D_first_stage_obstruction.py: 17 assertions checking the binomial recurrence, normalized shuffle faces, and both modulo-two candidates for the first transgression; 0.040277 seconds.\n- D_shift_quadratic_checks.py: 50 assertions using actual integral normalized Dold–Kan matrices for Sym² and Gamma² in shifts 1 through 4, their Smith-form homology and the shift-two Alexander–Whitney product; 0.323029 seconds. The output includes the full matrices, not only a recurrence check.\n\n'
if extra not in s:s=s.replace(marker,extra+marker)
