end=s.index('## Typesetting status',begin)
table=(root/'notes/CORRECTIONS_table.md').read_text()
corrections='## Corrections to the supplied materials\n\nThe following records locate each correction in the supplied prompt, study, readings or transcriptions. They distinguish a mathematical correction, a qualification of scope, a completed proof and a documentary uncertainty. The machine-readable version is RESEARCH_SA08_corrections.tsv; its component registers preserve additional details. A correction of an AI transcription does not by itself establish that the same slip is in the manuscript.\n\n'+table+'\n'
